<title>CHINA: China summer grain output seen 115 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>China summer grain output seen 115 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's summer grain output was expected to reach 115 million tonnes this year, the State Planning Commission said in a report issued by the official Xinhua news agency on Tuesday.</p>
<p>That marked an increase of four million tonnes over last year's summer harvest, it said.</p>
<p>State media had earlier estimated the summer grain harvest would reach a record 118 million tonnes, up 3.5 percent from last year.</p>
<p>The Ministry of Internal Trade has forecast grain output for this year at above 484 million tonnes, against a record 490 million tonnes last year.</p>
</text>
